{"seq":3,"slug":"inspection-metrics-supplier-scorecard","title":"检验度量与供应商记分卡：PPM、验货通过率与准入降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/lot-disposition-supplier/inspection-metrics-supplier-scorecard","wordCount":3086,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"检验度量与供应商记分卡-ppm-验货通过率与准入降级\">检验度量与供应商记分卡：PPM、验货通过率与准入降级</h1><p>一家采购商每月收到 40 批验货报告，其中 37 批判&quot;通过&quot;。这 37 批是同一个供应商吗？是同一类产品吗？每批查的是同一个 AQL 吗？如果答案不同，那么&quot;92.5% 的通过率&quot;是一句无法支撑任何决策的话。**检验度量要解决的问题，不是把报告抄进一张表，而是把&quot;通过/不通过&quot;这种二元结果，压成一组量纲统一、能跨批次跨工厂比较、并被写进合同与准入规则的数字。**本文从 PPM 这类缺陷密度指标讲起，一路推到一份能触发供应商降级的记分卡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>供应商质量度量分两层：<strong>件级密度</strong>（一批货里坏了多少）与 <strong>批级通过</strong>（多少批被判接收）。两者量纲不同，各自回答不同的问题，混用就会算出一个既不像缺陷率也不像通过率的怪数。先钉死词汇：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>量纲</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PPM / DPPM</td>\n<td>Parts (Defective Parts) Per Million</td>\n<td>每百万受检件里有多少不合格品</td>\n<td>件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DPU</td>\n<td>Defects Per Unit</td>\n<td>平均每件上有几个缺陷</td>\n<td>缺陷/件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DPMO</td>\n<td>Defects Per Million Opportunities</td>\n<td>每个缺陷机会的百万分缺陷数</td>\n<td>机会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FPY</td>\n<td>First Pass Yield</td>\n<td>多少件一次就过、无需返工</td>\n<td>件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FRI</td>\n<td>First Run Inspection 通过率</td>\n<td>多少批首次判定即接收</td>\n<td>批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LQ</td>\n<td>Limiting Quality</td>\n<td>低接收概率水平（通常 10%）对应的质量</td>\n<td>质量水平</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>**PPM 与 DPU 不是一回事，也不能互换。**一个保温杯盖子上有 3 处划痕，它是一件不合格品的背后可能有多个缺陷。PPM 数的是&quot;件&quot;，DPU 数的是&quot;缺陷&quot;——同一批货，PPM 可以很低（只有少数几件坏），DPU 却可以很高（少数坏件上毛病密集）。选择哪个，取决于你想改善的是&quot;产线良率&quot;（PPM）还是&quot;单件工艺成熟度&quot;（DPU）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[现场检验记录&lt;br/&gt;逐件逐点缺陷] --&gt; B[件级度量&lt;br/&gt;PPM / DPU / DPMO]&#10;  A --&gt; C[批级度量&lt;br/&gt;FRI / FPY / RTY]&#10;  B --&gt; D[加权记分卡&lt;br/&gt;多维度合成总分]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E{分档判定&lt;br/&gt;Preferred / Approved / Probation / Disqualified}&#10;  E --&gt;|升级| F[加单 / 免检 / Reduced]&#10;  E --&gt;|维持| G[Normal 正常检验]&#10;  E --&gt;|降级| H[SCAR + 8D + Tightened&lt;br/&gt;新单冻结]\">graph TD\n  A[现场检验记录&lt;br/&gt;逐件逐点缺陷] --&gt; B[件级度量&lt;br/&gt;PPM / DPU / DPMO]\n  A --&gt; C[批级度量&lt;br/&gt;FRI / FPY / RTY]\n  B --&gt; D[加权记分卡&lt;br/&gt;多维度合成总分]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E{分档判定&lt;br/&gt;Preferred / Approved / Probation / Disqualified}\n  E --&gt;|升级| F[加单 / 免检 / Reduced]\n  E --&gt;|维持| G[Normal 正常检验]\n  E --&gt;|降级| H[SCAR + 8D + Tightened&lt;br/&gt;新单冻结]</pre><h2 id=\"ppm-dpu-与-dpmo-把判定结果折算成可比密度\">PPM、DPU 与 DPMO：把判定结果折算成可比密度</h2><p>一件产品在 AQL 表上只有&quot;合格/不合格&quot;两态，落到报告里却是可加总的计数。三个公式把计数压成密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>不合格品件数</mtext><mtext>受检件数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PPM = \\frac{\\text{不合格品件数}}{\\text{受检件数}} \\times 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">受检件数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不合格品件数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>缺陷总数</mtext><mtext>受检件数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>缺陷总数</mtext><mrow><mtext>受检件数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>每件缺陷机会数</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DPU = \\frac{\\text{缺陷总数}}{\\text{受检件数}}, \\qquad DPMO = \\frac{\\text{缺陷总数}}{\\text{受检件数} \\times \\text{每件缺陷机会数}} \\times 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">受检件数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缺陷总数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">受检件数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每件缺陷机会数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缺陷总数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>PPM 只在样本量足够大时才有分辨率：100 件样本里 1 件坏，PPM 就是 10000；但如果只抽了 5 件、坏了 1 件，PPM 是 200000——这个数字的置信区间宽到毫无意义。<strong>跨国采购实务里 PPM 通常按&quot;季度累计件数&quot;而非单批计算</strong>，正是因为单批样本量撑不起百万分率这个量纲。DPU 与 DPMO 的分母不同：DPU 以&quot;件&quot;为单位，DPMO 以&quot;缺陷机会&quot;为单位，机会数需要在检验规范（SI）里事前定义（一块 PCB 有 200 个焊点就是 200 个机会）。六个西格玛体系正是用 DPMO 把不同产品、不同复杂度的过程拉平比较（见 ASQ 六西格玛术语，<a href=\"https://asq.org/quality-resources/six-sigma\">asq.org</a>）。</p>\n<p>**关键陷阱：AQL 不等于 PPM，也不等于缺陷率。**AQL 是一个&quot;接收质量限&quot;——它定义的是&quot;以多大比例接收批&quot;的水平，不是&quot;允许多少缺陷率出货&quot;。ISO 3534-2 明确定义 AQL 为&quot;被认为可接受的过程平均质量的上限&quot;，而到达 AQL 的批只有约 95% 的接收概率；与它配对的 **LQ（极限质量）**在 AQL 的约 10 倍处、接收概率仅约 10%（ISO 3534-2《统计学 词汇与符号 第 2 部分：应用统计学》）。这意味着：<strong>一批按 AQL 1.0 判&quot;通过&quot;的货，其真实不合格品率完全可能是 3%、5% 甚至更高</strong>。用&quot;验货通过率=100%&quot;去推断&quot;PPM 很低&quot;，是把接收判定误当成了质量水平——这是把 AQL 结果折算成供应商得分时最常见的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验货通过率与一次通过率-批级视角的度量\">验货通过率与一次通过率：批级视角的度量</h2><p>件级密度之外，另一条线是批级通过。它有两个容易混淆的版本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>首次判定接收的批数</mtext><mtext>受检批数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>一次通过件数</mtext><mtext>投入件数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FRI = \\frac{\\text{首次判定接收的批数}}{\\text{受检批数}} \\times 100\\% \\qquad FPY = \\frac{\\text{一次通过件数}}{\\text{投入件数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">受检批数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">首次判定接收的批数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">投入件数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一次通过件数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>多道工序的滚动通过率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTY = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} FPY_i \\quad (\\text{多道工序的滚动通过率})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">多道工序的滚动通过率</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>FRI（首次通过率）是采购方最常挂在报表上的&quot;验货通过率&quot;，分子是判&quot;接收&quot;的批数，分母是全部受检批数。它直观，但<strong>受检验水平与 AQL 设置摆布</strong>：把 AQL 从 1.0 放宽到 2.5，通过率立刻升高，产品本身一件没变。因此 FRI 只有在&quot;检验方案固定&quot;的前提下才有跨期可比性——这也是 ISO 2859-1 与国标 GB/T 2828.1-2012 都要求记录&quot;所用检验水平与 AQL&quot;的原因。FPY 则要区分&quot;初次检验即合格&quot;与&quot;经返工后合格&quot;，售后与返修成本只有前者能反映，混用会让良率虚高。</p>\n<p>批级度量的另一个价值是 <strong>switching rules（转移规则）</strong>。ISO 2859-1 规定：连续若干批正常检验全部接收，可转 <strong>reduced（放宽）</strong> 检验；一旦出现拒收，立即 <strong>tightened（加严）</strong> 检验，加严状态下连续 5 批接收才可回到正常。<strong>这套规则本身就是一台自动档的供应商监视器</strong>——&quot;当前处于加严状态&quot;就是一个比通过率更硬的降级预警信号，可直接喂进记分卡的&quot;检验状态&quot;维度。而这些批级数字的输入口径，取决于每一批用的是哪套接收数/拒收数方案（详见 <a href=\"../aql-sampling-plan/sampling-plan-ac-re-calculation\">抽样方案与接收数/拒收数计算</a>）——方案一改，同一份通过率就换了含义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"记分卡构建-维度-权重与数据来源\">记分卡构建：维度、权重与数据来源</h2><p>一张能用的供应商质量记分卡，不是把十来个指标平铺，而是明确<strong>谁供数、谁加权、卡在什么阈值</strong>。汽车行业最早把它制度化：IATF 16949:2016 要求组织对供应商绩效做监视；ISO 9001:2015 在 §8.4（外部提供的过程、产品和服务的控制）与 §9.1.3（分析与评价）中要求把外部供方绩效纳入监视与评价（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/62085.html\">iso.org</a>）。落到跨境电商场景，常见的四维结构如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>代表指标</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>典型权重</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来料质量</td>\n<td>PPM、DPU、关键缺陷数</td>\n<td>PSI / IQC 报告</td>\n<td>35%–45%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检验表现</td>\n<td>FRI、加严状态、报告一次合格率</td>\n<td>第三方检验机构报告</td>\n<td>15%–25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交付履约</td>\n<td>准时率、批次完整率、缺件率</td>\n<td>物流与收货记录</td>\n<td>15%–25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协同响应</td>\n<td>SCAR 关闭时效、8D 报告质量、索赔率</td>\n<td>质量事故台账</td>\n<td>15%–20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>该维度归一化分值</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum_{i} w_i \\cdot s_i, \\qquad s_i = \\text{该维度归一化分值} \\in [0,100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该维度归一化分值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加权前必须把每个维度归一化到同一量纲，否则&quot;PPM 只有 800&quot;和&quot;准时率 98%&quot;会被直接相加。常见做法是<strong>分段线性映射</strong>：给每个指标设目标值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 与不可接受的下限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，落在区间内按比例给分，超出目标封顶 100，低于下限给 0。这避免一个极端值拉爆总分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准入分档与降级机制-让分数产生后果\">准入分档与降级机制：让分数产生后果</h2><p>记分卡若不绑定准入动作，就只是一张月报。行业通行的做法是把连续总分切成四档，每档对应明确的下单与检验策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>分数区间（示例）</th>\n<th>检验策略</th>\n<th>下单/准入动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Preferred 优选</td>\n<td>≥ 90</td>\n<td>Reduced 放宽检验、部分免检</td>\n<td>优先分配订单、新品试点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Approved 合格</td>\n<td>75–89</td>\n<td>Normal 正常检验</td>\n<td>维持现有份额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Probation 观察</td>\n<td>60–74</td>\n<td>Tightened 加严检验、100% 驻厂</td>\n<td>冻结新单、要求整改计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Disqualified 淘汰</td>\n<td>&lt; 60 或触发红线</td>\n<td>全检 + 第三方监装</td>\n<td>停止合作、启动替换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>**&quot;红线项&quot;必须与总分解耦。**分数是连续量，但有几类事件任何分数都不该豁免：关键缺陷（Critical）导致的人身安全或法规违规、连续 3 批拒收、伪造检验报告、擅自更换原材料或代工厂。红线一旦命中，直接降级而不看加权总分——把&quot;合规底线&quot;与&quot;绩效高低&quot;分成两件事。这套逻辑与欧盟 GPSR（通用产品安全法规 (EU) 2023/988）对不合规产品的市场撤出要求同源：安全违规是市场准入问题，不是打分问题。</p>\n<p>降级不是终点，而是触发 <strong>SCAR（Supplier Corrective Action Request，供应商纠正措施要求）</strong> 的入口。收到 SCAR 的供应商需在约定时限内提交 <strong>8D 报告</strong>（源自 Ford Motor Company 的问题解决八步法：组建团队、描述问题、临时遏制、根因分析、永久对策、实施验证、预防再发、团队表彰）。<strong>SCAR 的关闭时效与 8D 的根因质量本身就是一个记分卡维度</strong>——它衡量供应商&quot;出问题后能不能自己修好&quot;，比&quot;从不犯错&quot;更现实。整改验证通过后供应商从 Probation 回到 Approved，但通常需经观察期（例如连续 3 批正常检验接收）才恢复原份额——对应 ISO 2859-1 加严转正常需连续 5 批接收的保守思想。## 数据陷阱：为什么同一份数据能算出两种结论</p>\n<p>记分卡最大的风险不是算错，而是<strong>用不可比的数据做比较</strong>。以下四类陷阱在跨境场景中尤其常见：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>机理</th>\n<th>规避做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AQL 变动</td>\n<td>放宽 AQL 使通过率虚高</td>\n<td>冻结检验方案，变更需版本化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量偏差</td>\n<td>小批量样本的 PPM 方差极大</td>\n<td>按季度累计，或改报批级 FRI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检验员差异</td>\n<td>同一批不同检验员判定不一致</td>\n<td>定期 R&amp;R 比对、留样复检</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>古德哈特定律</td>\n<td>指标一旦成为目标就被博弈</td>\n<td>多指标交叉、引入红线与突击审核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>古德哈特定律（Goodhart&#39;s Law）在供应商管理里表现为&quot;刷分行为&quot;</strong>：当记分卡只看&quot;验货通过率&quot;，供应商最省力的优化是把外观松的批次排在前面、把可疑批次留到换班。这就是为什么成熟的记分卡总是<strong>混合度量</strong>——件级 PPM 抓真实质量、批级 FRI 抓流程稳定、红线抓合规底线、售后索赔率抓&quot;检验没抓到的东西&quot;。另一个常被忽略的口径是<strong>退货/索赔回流数据</strong>：验货通过但到货后被终端消费者退回，说明 PSI 抽样没覆盖到的问题（例如可靠性、耐久性），应回写进供应商的&quot;质量逃逸&quot;（quality escape）记录，而非只算在客服头上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>件级与批级分层度量</strong>：PPM/DPU/DPMO 描述缺陷密度，FRI/FPY/RTY 描述通过表现，二者量纲不同不可混用。</li>\n<li><strong>AQL 不是缺陷率</strong>：AQL 是接收质量限，LQ 约在 AQL 的 10 倍处，按 AQL 判&quot;通过&quot;的批其真实 PPM 可能远高于 AQL 数字，不能反推质量水平。</li>\n<li><strong>ISO 2859-1 的转移规则本身即监视器</strong>：&quot;处于加严状态&quot;是比通过率更硬的预警信号。</li>\n<li><strong>记分卡要绑定后果</strong>：四维加权（来料质量/检验表现/交付履约/协同响应）、归一化映射、四档准入策略，并为红线项与总分解耦。</li>\n<li><strong>降级触发 SCAR + 8D</strong>，关闭时效与根因质量本身计入评分；恢复份额需经观察期。</li>\n<li><strong>警惕数据陷阱</strong>：AQL 变动、样本量偏差、检验员差异、古德哈特定律；用多指标交叉验证抬高单点刷分成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>记分卡的最终目的不是给供应商排名，而是把&quot;下一单还能不能给&quot;变成由数据触发、有明确阈值、可追溯到 CA 记录的动作。看得见的部分（PPM、通过率）与看不见的部分（质量逃逸、根因能力）必须同时进表，否则分数越精确，决策越危险。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"检验度量与供应商记分卡：PPM、验货通过率与准入降级","id":"检验度量与供应商记分卡-ppm-验货通过率与准入降级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PPM、DPU 与 DPMO：把判定结果折算成可比密度","id":"ppm-dpu-与-dpmo-把判定结果折算成可比密度"},{"level":2,"text":"验货通过率与一次通过率：批级视角的度量","id":"验货通过率与一次通过率-批级视角的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"记分卡构建：维度、权重与数据来源","id":"记分卡构建-维度-权重与数据来源"},{"level":2,"text":"准入分档与降级机制：让分数产生后果","id":"准入分档与降级机制-让分数产生后果"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应商纠正措施 CAPA 与 8D 闭环机制：从 NCR 到有效性验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/lot-disposition-supplier/supplier-capa-8d-closure"},"next":null}